  {
    "id": 1,
    "description": "기본 공정 스케줄링 - 동일 Nice 0 태스크 2개의 정확한 50:50 시분할 및 공정 가상 런타임 진행",
    "input": "{\n  \"config\": {\n    \"sched_latency_ms\": 6.0,\n    \"min_granularity_ms\": 1.0,\n    \"enable_sleeper_fairness\": true\n  },\n  \"total_ticks\": 100,\n  \"events\": [\n    {\n      \"tick\": 0,\n      \"type\": \"create_task\",\n      \"task_id\": \"thread_A\",\n      \"nice\": 0\n    },\n    {\n      \"tick\": 0,\n      \"type\": \"create_task\",\n      \"task_id\": \"thread_B\",\n      \"nice\": 0\n    }\n  ]\n}",
    "expected_output": "{\n  \"verdict\": \"COMPLETELY_FAIR_WEIGHTED_SHARING\",\n  \"min_vruntime\": 50.0,\n  \"max_wait_latency_ms\": 1.0,\n  \"tasks\": {\n    \"thread_A\": {\n      \"nice\": 0,\n      \"weight\": 1024,\n      \"total_exec_time_ms\": 50.0,\n      \"final_vruntime\": 50.0,\n      \"max_wait_latency_ms\": 1.0\n    },\n    \"thread_B\": {\n      \"nice\": 0,\n      \"weight\": 1024,\n      \"total_exec_time_ms\": 50.0,\n      \"final_vruntime\": 50.0,\n      \"max_wait_latency_ms\": 1.0\n    }\n  }\n}"
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "description": "우선순위 가중치 스케줄링 - Nice -5(고우선순위) 대 Nice +5(저우선순위)의 약 9.3:1 CPU 시간 차등 분배",
    "input": "{\n  \"config\": {\n    \"sched_latency_ms\": 6.0,\n    \"min_granularity_ms\": 1.0,\n    \"enable_sleeper_fairness\": true\n  },\n  \"total_ticks\": 1000,\n  \"events\": [\n    {\n      \"tick\": 0,\n      \"type\": \"create_task\",\n      \"task_id\": \"high_prio\",\n      \"nice\": -5\n    },\n    {\n      \"tick\": 0,\n      \"type\": \"create_task\",\n      \"task_id\": \"low_prio\",\n      \"nice\": 5\n    }\n  ]\n}",
    "expected_output": "{\n  \"verdict\": \"COMPLETELY_FAIR_WEIGHTED_SHARING\",\n  \"min_vruntime\": 296.274,\n  \"max_wait_latency_ms\": 10.0,\n  \"tasks\": {\n    \"high_prio\": {\n      \"nice\": -5,\n      \"weight\": 3121,\n      \"total_exec_time_ms\": 903.0,\n      \"final_vruntime\": 296.274,\n      \"max_wait_latency_ms\": 1.0\n    },\n    \"low_prio\": {\n      \"nice\": 5,\n      \"weight\": 335,\n      \"total_exec_time_ms\": 97.0,\n      \"final_vruntime\": 296.501,\n      \"max_wait_latency_ms\": 10.0\n    }\n  }\n}"
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "description": "슬리퍼 기아 방어 미적용 시의 대재앙 - 장시간 잠든 스레드가 깨어나 워커 스레드를 50ms 이상 CPU 기아 상태로 독점",
    "input": "{\n  \"config\": {\n    \"sched_latency_ms\": 6.0,\n    \"min_granularity_ms\": 1.0,\n    \"enable_sleeper_fairness\": false\n  },\n  \"total_ticks\": 120,\n  \"events\": [\n    {\n      \"tick\": 0,\n      \"type\": \"create_task\",\n      \"task_id\": \"worker\",\n      \"nice\": 0\n    },\n    {\n      \"tick\": 0,\n      \"type\": \"create_task\",\n      \"task_id\": \"audio\",\n      \"nice\": 0\n    },\n    {\n      \"tick\": 10,\n      \"type\": \"sleep\",\n      \"task_id\": \"audio\",\n      \"duration\": 50\n    }\n  ]\n}",
    "expected_output": "{\n  \"verdict\": \"CATASTROPHIC_SLEEPER_CPU_MONOPOLY\",\n  \"min_vruntime\": 60.0,\n  \"max_wait_latency_ms\": 51.0,\n  \"tasks\": {\n    \"audio\": {\n      \"nice\": 0,\n      \"weight\": 1024,\n      \"total_exec_time_ms\": 60.0,\n      \"final_vruntime\": 60.0,\n      \"max_wait_latency_ms\": 1.0\n    },\n    \"worker\": {\n      \"nice\": 0,\n      \"weight\": 1024,\n      \"total_exec_time_ms\": 60.0,\n      \"final_vruntime\": 60.0,\n      \"max_wait_latency_ms\": 51.0\n    }\n  }\n}"
  },
  {
